  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-skyblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Absorption Power Link</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/51/Nanatsu_no_Taizai_Ban_Snatch_Physical_Hunt.gif/revision/latest?cb=20220412024638\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Nanatsu no Taizai Ban Snatch Physical Hunt\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/51/Nanatsu_no_Taizai_Ban_Snatch_Physical_Hunt.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20220412024638\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/51/Nanatsu_no_Taizai_Ban_Snatch_Physical_Hunt.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20220412024638 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/51/Nanatsu_no_Taizai_Ban_Snatch_Physical_Hunt.gif/revision/latest?cb=20220412024638 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Nanatsu no Taizai Ban Snatch Physical Hunt\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Nanatsu_no_Taizai_Ban_Snatch_Physical_Hunt.gif\" data-image-name=\"Nanatsu no Taizai Ban Snatch Physical Hunt.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Ban (Nanatsu no Taizai/The Seven Deadly Sins) can enhance his already impressive strength with the absorptive capability of his magic power, Snatch, such as with his technique Physical Hunt.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Have your absorptive nature link to your powers.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The ability to <b>have one's absorptive nature linked to one's powers</b>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Self_Power_Link\" title=\"Self Power Link\">Self Power Link</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Anime/Manga/Manhwa\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Anime/Manga/Manhwa</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Comics\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Comics</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Games\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Games</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Anime/Manga/Manhwa_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Anime/Manga/Manhwa</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Power_Link%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can make their absorptive nature connect to their powers and use it to control them. The assimilation fuels the powers and allows them to be strengthened and utilized on various levels.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Power_Link%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Empowerment\" title=\"Absorption Empowerment\">Absorption Empowerment</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Power_Link%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Absorbing Replication\">Absorbing Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Arts\" title=\"Absorption Arts\">Absorption Arts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Absorption Energy Manipulation\">Absorption Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Magic\" title=\"Absorption Magic\">Absorption Magic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Manipulation\" title=\"Absorption Manipulation\">Absorption Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Absorption\">Personal Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Metabolization\" title=\"Metabolization\">Metabolization</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Weaponry\" title=\"Absorption Weaponry\">Absorption Weaponry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilative_Evolution\" title=\"Assimilative Evolution\">Assimilative Evolution</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilative_Infection\" title=\"Assimilative Infection\">Assimilative Infection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Digestive_Assimilation\" title=\"Digestive Assimilation\">Digestive Assimilation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self_Power_Link\" title=\"Self Power Link\">Self Power Link</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Self-Power Augmentation\">Self-Power Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Power_Bestowal\" title=\"Self-Power Bestowal\">Self-Power Bestowal</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Power_Link%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May go out of control if the absorptive nature is unstable.</li>\n<li>May require a specific <a href=\"/wiki/State_of_Mind\" title=\"State of Mind\">State of Mind</a> or state of being.</li>\n<li>Users of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Foreign_Forces_Removal\" title=\"Foreign Forces Removal\">Foreign Forces Removal</a> may be able to defeat user.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Power_Link%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"Anime.2FManga.2FManhwa\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Anime/Manga/Manhwa\">Anime/Manga/Manhwa</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Power_Link%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"scrollable\" style=\"overflow:auto; max-height:275px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0.5em; background:transparent;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://blackclover.fandom.com/wiki/Ladros\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:blackclover:Ladros\">Ladros</a> (<i>Black Clover</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blackclover.fandom.com/wiki/Henry_Legolant\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bla